"顶部可最小化窗口或隐藏整个应用。点击查看影响范围和动画说明。" = "Minimize a window or hide the entire application at the top edge. Click for scope and animation details.";
"关闭：只在当前桌面收放。开启：允许激活窗口时切换到它所在的桌面，不搬动窗口的桌面归属。推荐把应用分配给所有桌面。" = "Off: act only on this desktop. On: activating a window may switch to its desktop without moving it between desktops. Assigning the app to All Desktops is recommended.";
"macOS 和许多应用会限制窗口移出屏幕顶部。\n\n最小化窗口：只收起绑定窗口。隐藏整个应用：同一应用的所有窗口一起隐藏，恢复时将绑定窗口置前，保留原位置和尺寸。\n\n两种方式都通过顶部对应区段或快捷键恢复，鼠标移开后按离开延迟收起。停留和离开延迟有效；过渡由 macOS 控制，不使用 Peek 的展开、收起时长。\n\n关闭后，方向菜单移除“顶部”，已有顶部绑定暂停收起，已收起的窗口仍可召回。" = "macOS and many applications restrict moving windows above the screen.\n\nMinimize window: hide only the bound window. Hide application: hide all windows of that application together. Restoring brings the bound window forward and preserves its position and size.\n\nBoth modes restore through the corresponding top edge segment or shortcut, then hide after the pointer leaves. Show and hide delays apply. macOS controls the transitions; Peek’s show and hide durations do not apply.\n\nTurning this off removes Top from direction menus and stops new top-edge hides. Windows already hidden by Peek can still be restored.";
"关闭：只在当前桌面收放。\n\n开启：Hover 或快捷键可能切走当前桌面，转到窗口所在的桌面。不会把窗口搬到当前桌面；能否切换由 macOS 决定。\n\n推荐：Dock 中右键目标应用 → 选项 → 分配给 → 所有桌面。" = "Off: act only on this desktop.\n\nOn: hover or a shortcut may switch to the window's desktop. It does not move the window to this desktop. macOS controls whether the switch succeeds.\n\nRecommended: right-click the app in the Dock → Options → Assign To → All Desktops.";
