"隐藏整个应用会同时隐藏该应用的所有窗口。\n\n如果应用有多个窗口，例如浏览器或 Finder，建议使用“最小化窗口”，只收起绑定窗口。\n\n此设置统一用于所有选择顶部收放的应用。" = "Hide application hides all windows of that app.\n\nFor apps with multiple windows, such as browsers or Finder, use Minimize window to hide only the bound window.\n\nThis setting applies to all apps that use top-edge hiding.";
